OL,3,GNEWSAA1 crash victim was about to begin
OL,4,A'dream job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old woman who died in a
OL,7,Fthree-vehicle crash in Northumberland
OL,8,Fover the weekend was about to embark on
OL,9,Fher "dream job", her family has said.
OL,11,FErin Bennett, who died at the scene of
OL,12,Fthe crash, on the A1 near Felton on
OL,13,FSunday, 18 October, was about to start
OL,14,Fher training with Northumbria Police to
OL,15,Fbecome a detective, having graduated
OL,16,Fwith a degree in criminology and
OL,17,Fpsychology.
OL,19,FHer family paid tribute to a "caring,
OL,20,Fthoughtful" woman with a "contagious
OL,21,Fsmile".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
