OL,3,GNEWSAA1 crash victim was about to begin
OL,4,A'dream job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police has appealed for
OL,7,Fwitnesses to the collision, which
OL,8,Finvolved a white Nissan Qashqai car
OL,9,Ftravelling northbound and a red Renault
OL,10,FClio and a white Tesla travelling
OL,11,Fsouthbound at about 12:15 BST.
